---LINES

mainv   = gh  - - - - "main view"
mainvk  = gm  - - - - "main view keys:"

cmded   = gh  - - - - "command editor"
cmdedk  = gm  - - - - "command editor keys:"

exit    = gh  - - - - "exit indicator"
exitk   = gm  - - - - "exit code indicator keys:"

hist    = gh  - - - - "history view"
histk   = gm  - - - - "history view keys:"

runcmd  = gh  - - - - "command execution"

m       = gm  - - - - " *)"

cmd     = ghx - - - -  "[a-z./]"
CMD     = ghx - - - -  "[A-Z0-9]"

---SCREEN
=vash workflow                                      
+                                            for more details see 'man vash'       
+.mainvk.................................                                     
+.'lowercase or .'. or .'/ :                 exit:                     help:  
+    - type a command from scratch    {1}    .:EX...                   .:HE...
+.'other :                                   .mainv...........................
+    - edit a command from template   {2}     ^    ^  .:CA  .cmd...   .CMD....
+    - execute predefined command     {3}     :    :   :        :      :    : 
+ .:CA - switch to editor                     :    :   :       {1}    {2}  {3}
+                                             :   .:CA :        :      :    : 
+.cmdedk.................................     :   .cmded................... : 
+  .:NL...  - run a command, sync history     :      ^   ^  .:HE... .:NL... : 
+  .:HE...  - switch to history view          :      :   :     :       :    : 
+                                             :      : .:NL... :       :    : 
+.histk..................................     :      : ."history".     :    : 
+  .:NL...  - take a command to editor        :      :                 :    : 
+  .:CA     - return to editor untouched      :      :                 :    : 
+                                             :     {1}  .runcmd..............
+.exitk..................................    .:CA    :        :
+  .:CA, .:SP... - return to main view       .:SP... .cmd...  :              
+  type a command - return to editor         .exit............. <-- .:NL...
                                                            
---END                                                        
+  .:NL...  - defencive trap for mistakes   
+                                     .m. see 'man vash' for details

